                <invention-title lang="de">MOTORSYSTEM ZUR EMISSIONSREDUKTION OHNE NACHBEHANDLUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME DE MOTEUR POUR RÉDUCTION D'ÉMISSIONS SANS POST-TRAITEMENT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ENGINE SYSTEM FOR EMISSION REDUCTION WITHOUT AFTERTREATMENT</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A piston for an internal combustion engine, the piston comprising: a bowl that is machined into a top surface of the piston, the bowl comprising a bottom, a salient angle formed between the top surface of the piston and a side of the bowl, an opening diameter, and a depth, wherein the salient angle projects in a direction from the opening diameter to a rim of the piston such that the ratio between the opening diameter and the depth affects the salient angle, the depth ranges approximately from 0.5 to 2.0, and the piston is configured to form a portion of a combustion chamber of the internal combustion engine.</p>
            </abstract>
